## `.htaccess`

```apache
RewriteEngine On

# Route supported clean URLs through the front controller.
RewriteRule ^(menu|about|contact|order|food)/?$ index.php?page=$1 [L,QSA]

# Send unknown URLs through the front controller's 404 page.
RewriteCond %{REQUEST_FILENAME} !-f
RewriteCond %{REQUEST_FILENAME} !-d
RewriteRule ^ index.php?page=404 [L,QSA]
```

